ations, educational institutes, and IT industries. The company was incorporated in 2020 and is based in Pune, India. Alphalogic Industries Limited operates as a subsidiary of Alphalogic Techsys Limited.","employees":9,"earnDates":[],"exDiv":null,"asOf":1795089901},"analyst":null,"cap":"Other","caFix":null,"fetched":1795089900,"source":"Yahoo Finance (public chart, fundamentals-timeseries & quoteSummary endpoints)","news":{"q":"\"Alphalogic Industries\" stock when:90d","items":[{"t":"M & B Engineering Ltd commences commercial production at Phase 1 of PEB Manufacturing Facility","s":"EquityBulls","d":1793014068,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxOREVINWIyWkxCTkJud3Z6T0lRanY2bUFKX1pnUXVPYUEwTmp2cmozUms1cDNkV1RHNnhLNHlzdDNOaTRnODRBSWxYd2VzYk1PQmd4S0RJcnV2YnZLMGFwYlF3eEdidjk0bGlTVDBKMHp4Q3o3dVNlOGlKS3YyMnh4MFc4MGR3aHFfVWdKa0pHZWlPWF90NHR3MFBQZTJpMXFGQXRjNUNqNk1QTFZIQXZSWFpNWDVnci1qTE43MA?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Up to 89% profit CAGR: 3 little-known manufacturing SMEs among industry giants","s":"The Financial Express","d":1791615600,"u":"https://news.google.?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Alphalogic Industries declares AGM voting results; all resolutions pass","s":"scanx.trade","d":1790406000,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxNZDNNUWh3RUpWcDNUR183RjY5TFVDSUlCT1htNUlqLTAxcUwtUm13Q2YtNjh5N2xuRUF5dWhFQzN5RVRfYmVabHVHcmtmRC1PNFpNdDFkNW83cGZoVkVHZW1oT09HREp6UnBaemY5NGlVal9pRmVGVmZGUlNDTldMM1k1bHV3U1p0elJlWVU5YUxnU296UUxldk13b0Q4blQxbEp5OW5nRVNyRXZMTVNsNTA1OA?oc=5","g":[]}],"asOf":1795089901,"source":"Google News RSS"},"exClose":{"ex":"BSE","day":"2026-11-19"},"canslim":{"L":{"C":{"s":"na","v":null,"why":"Need latest quarter EPS and the same quarter a year earlier (positive) — not available"},"A":{"s":"pass","v":1.0443,"why":"Annual EPS CAGR +104% over 4 fiscal years, rising every year (needs ≥ +25%/yr)"},"N":{"s":"fail","v":-0.246,"why":"25% below 52-week high (needs within 15%; O'Neil also wants a new product/catalyst — check news)"},"S":{"s":"fa